status GREEN -- ascii_document witness GREEN at 45 behaviors, control_verdict=ok with every behavior yes; cold roster 198 guards 195 green 0 red 3 gated and hot roster 198 guards 195 green 0 red 3 gated, tree_moved=no on both, none of the three gates mine; fold_shelf_link_repoint reds repaired to verdict=ok; index_row_bound, shell_comment_ascii and exec_bit green. One hot pass void by my own edit under it, named above and re-run whole.
